| RQ-005, RQ-016 | jarvis connect gdrive (one OAuth: Gmail, Calendar, Tasks) | pending connectors doc | README.md, quickstart.md |
| RQ-012 | enforce_tool_confirmation (author: not enforced, entry-point dependent); requires_confirmation per tool | pending system-access.md | configuration.md, snippets.md |
| RQ-030 | Ollama recommended; local-first default when no cloud key in env | pending | install.md, installation.md |
| RQ-031 | learning loop requires [traces] enabled = true | pending memory.md, learning | configuration.md |
