security, system-access, agents, scheduler, morning-digest).

## D. DIVERGENCE REGISTER
| ID | Area | Author | Graystone (measured W76) | Class | Note |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| D-01 | Install location | %LOCALAPPDATA%\OpenJarvis\src or ~/.openjarvis/src | C:\Users\Admin\OpenJarvis repo, own .venv | CHOICE | dev repo is the runtime |
| D-02 | Service | scheduled task jarvis-service.ps1 | none; manual admin start-openjarvis.ps1; file absent from repo | LAG | author added after 05-19 |
| D-03 | Engine host | [engine.ollama] host | no [engine.ollama] section; remote Ollama 172.16.33.200 | OPEN | source of host not yet measured |
| D-04 | Storage section | [tools.storage] | legacy [memory] | LAG | backward compatible |
| D-05 | Default agent | simple / server orchestrator | native_openhands (both) | CHOICE | CodeAct agent |
| D-06 | Default tools | none | code_interpreter, file_read, file_write, shell_exec, think, calculator, retrieval, 5 mailbox tools incl move_to_trash, empty_folder | CHOICE | destructive set, see H-W76-EXPOSURE |
| D-07 | Server bind | 127.0.0.1:8000 | 0.0.0.0:8010 | CHOICE | author: auth first; H-W74-AUTHOFF |
| D-08 | Tool confirmation | true, not enforced | unset (default true, not enforced) | MATCH | gap is the author's; RQ-012, Defect 6 |
| D-09 | Traces | false | unset (false) | MATCH | blocks RQ-031 learning, runbook Desktop 9 |
| D-10 | Extra sections | not in configuration.md | [speech] model base; [analytics] enabled false | OPEN | verify against author docs |
| D-11 | Default model | empty (router) | qwen3-coder:30b | CHOICE | |
| D-12 | Desktop | prebuilt or tauri build | production tauri build from repo | CHOICE | production only (owner rule) |
HAZARD H-W76-EXPOSURE: D-05 + D-06 + D-07 + D-08 together = LAN-bound server, CodeAct agent with
shell and destructive mailbox tools, confirmation not enforced (author-documented). Confirm auth
state by whole-file upload of server\app.py (BRIEF W75 item 6).
